## [decision|done] Use Rust for the parser

→ supersedes: old-node-parser.emd
→ implements: perf-spec.emd
After benchmarking, Rust with logos + pulldown-cmark parsed 500 sections in under 5ms.

## [api] POST /auth/login

```json
{
  "email": "string",
  "password": "string"
}
```

Returns a session token.

